#: ../../source/workspaces/index.rst:2
msgid "Workspaces and Sessions"
msgstr "工作区和会话"

#: ../../source/workspaces/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Workspaces define where Studio is allowed to work. Sessions keep the work"
" organized inside those boundaries."
msgstr "工作区定义 Studio 可以在哪里工作，会话则帮助你在这些边界内整理工作。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"Choose a workspace for the task you are doing. If you have several Godot "
"projects, keep them as separate workspaces so file paths, Git changes, "
"and Godot context stay easy to understand."
msgstr "请为当前任务选择一个工作区。如果你有多个 Godot 项目，请将它们分别作为独立工作区，这样文件路径、Git 变更和 Godot 上下文会更容易理解。"
